{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a5a5c74155d4bbc5a1fa9bb3bcf53af3973043cc9d53844e1e4cf141095742d", "ja": "（よし、水上ゲームエリアも問題なさそうだな。\n後は、ステージの最終チェックを……）", "zh": "（好，水上游戏区看起来也没问题。接下来再做一下舞台的最终检查……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "5dc198cabef04e3c10d3a78c48f278461cbae5eaf83ea8dea6be302d6df04b3d", "ja": "あ、あら？　どうしましょう、ば、バランスが……！\nきゃああああっ……！", "zh": "啊、啊啦？这、这可怎么办，平、平衡……！\n呀啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "31fafc7db649749a553559f1aa0b8b45457c065eb76f127576b1cf55b7561296", "ja": "えっ……あれは……あ、あずささん！？", "zh": "诶……那是……啊、是梓小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1003_se", "source_sha256": "089c05a0637500f66d9241e93e29ca49c1d41e40923903b1b537d00c807556fa", "ja": "バッシャーン", "zh": "哗啦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "0a7659ad4248a10f87e547992de01bf636dabe3e287c932293286191bb7587ca", "ja": "す、すみません、{$P$}さん\n助けていただいちゃって……。", "zh": "对、对不起，{$P$}先生，还让您帮了我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4af180449d93fcef53d9e316259df335766bf6ed398acbb3fffe269d183a7a75", "ja": "いえいえ、むしろ助けにいける距離でよかったです。\nあずささんは、ケガありませんか？", "zh": "不不，倒不如说，幸好距离够近，能赶过去帮忙。\n梓小姐，你没受伤吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "a879f5cdcf955c81b99ba20aad126dfc015ba5a298f2aefa671981e2e629d1c5", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です。{$P$}さんが\nすぐに起こしてくれましたから……。", "zh": "是的，我没事。因为{$P$}先生马上把我扶起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "a9832d60eed508bc2b6de20bcaf37869c84526e3cacdc17bf8ef7e440e99e98d", "ja": "まさか浮き輪があんな風にひっくり返るなんて、\nびっくりしちゃいました。", "zh": "没想到救生圈居然会那样翻过来，真是吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3abea298ec3b72259271a1e6a8fe7e9ce2be801af5596eaef1294cd17f58b048", "ja": "ここの浮き輪はどれも、実用性より見栄え重視って\n感じですもんね。フラミンゴとかペガサスとか……。", "zh": "这里的游泳圈感觉全都是比起实用性，更注重外观呢。火烈鸟啦、飞马啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "79e7a871b7f84d45944c50318d031dd24dd451f69ba9522755ae45c403a53d72", "ja": "でも、どれもカラフルで、かわいらしいですよね。\nサイズも大人ふたりで乗れそうなくらい大きくて……。", "zh": "不过，每一个都色彩鲜艳，特别可爱呢。\n尺寸也很大，感觉两个大人一起坐都没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "d36b95754ef86d2c78dc57337ca16661cdf0aa93264730c067a217b40afadf42", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n今日は水着、持ってきていらっしゃらないんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生今天没带泳衣来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "501bcc5b3a447e54e46e8f91fa00cb4797e5a4b91e57a115de5680292e848c15", "ja": "そうですね、水着までは……。濡れてもいいように、\n着替えは一式持ってきましたけど。", "zh": "是啊，泳衣就没带……不过，我带了一整套换洗衣物，以防弄湿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "dd88424953b8015c51c3cbb44ffc4db5ca7f2b7bb19465369ba22394497dca0c", "ja": "まぁ、そうなんですね。せっかくですし、\n一緒に遊べたらと思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "是这样啊。难得有这个机会，我本来还想着要是能一起玩就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6709fd39c75252fa27db15668bbf87a7180d43b1dec17d128baf56d1499b7833", "ja": "さすがに、配信に映るわけにはいかないですからね。\nみんな楽しそうなので、ちょっと羨ましいですけど。", "zh": "毕竟，我也不能出现在直播画面里。看到大家玩得那么开心，虽然有点羡慕就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "66e16e70d5cc0165cf702c9d2502d6a67687e1d3e62b35b97319ba5f4c43ad5f", "ja": "あっ、そうでした！　この会場の様子、\nずっと生配信されているんでしたね。", "zh": "啊，对了！这个会场的情况，\n一直都在进行现场直播呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "b18782450c8b9d73f8f728f2d768fc2c4d5910e36e743c9c3f7c5670c5e13bae", "ja": "あら、ということは……もしかしてさっきの様子も\n配信されてしまったんでしょうか……！？", "zh": "哎呀，这么说来……刚才的样子不会也被直播出去了吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1017_p", "source_sha256": "40dd9347396f2422f3ab0754a1cbdfcdf4fc3e531a5c340fc1c90cd413367af0", "ja": "ははっ、大丈夫ですよ。\n今、配信カメラは別エリアにいるはずですから。", "zh": "哈哈，没事的。现在直播摄像机应该在别的区域。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "95e4babc349e93664f5a632ace4c1324f454ac6decca225e0f5ccad0c35acc31", "ja": "それならよかったです～。\nさすがにあの姿はちょっと、恥ずかしいので……。", "zh": "那就太好了～。\n毕竟那个样子实在有点……让人害羞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c3314f9b72605cab500fa2c5bde2e32df4fb360e2d89dda27af299502e14c9f6", "ja": "いえ……あれはあれで、\n配信していたら、絶対ウケてたんじゃないかなと……。", "zh": "不……我觉得那个样子其实也挺好的，\n要是当时在直播的话，肯定会大受欢迎的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "bfbbf87d6e6b9a03c3e71aff0a4e011a427b679e877591ca22bf5e56b9612440", "ja": "だ、ダメです～！　それに、その時は助けてくれた\n{$P$}さんも映っちゃいますよ？", "zh": "不、不行啦～！而且那时候帮助我的{$P$}先生也会被拍进去哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ef360fe18b4cb43a6d16067332a9e5698e72b4689522e2c4f270493d3b96790c", "ja": "ああ、そうでした。それはダメですね……ははっ。", "zh": "啊，对哦。那样可不行……哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0353_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "2782986b2d70a403091067b4f4fc255276e13fa2f316d072c947238014a3d120", "ja": "はい。ですからさっきのことは、私たち\nふたりだけの秘密で……。約束ですよ？　ふふっ♪", "zh": "好的。所以刚才的事，就当作只有我们两个人知道的秘密……说好了哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
